			"Message": "docs(Wind): Update documented workspace path to .fiddee directory\n\nThe inline comment in ResolveConfiguration referencing `~/.land/workspaces/RecentlyOpened.json` as the source for the `?folder=` URL parameter was stale after the product was rebranded to FIDDEE. Update the path to `~/.fiddee/workspaces/RecentlyOpened.json` to reflect the current Mountain data directory.\n\nNo behavior change — the comment is documentation-only.",
